  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "office",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "background": "backgrounds/curator-office.png"
      },
      "next": "line-001"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "室内。百叶窗切碎了外面的天光，桌上摊着几叠打印稿和喝空的茶杯。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-002"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-002",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "我的工作是替互联网整理历史。说白了，就是把那些关停的旧网页、沉寂下去的讨论区，还有不再有动静的名字，一个一个规整进档案里。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-003"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-003",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“互联网会记住一切。”说这句话的人，肯定没试过找回三年前收藏夹里的链接。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-004"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-004",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "从早上开始，我一直在翻chatgpt4o留下的旧对话。翻到最后一行，后面什么都没有了。当时她是我的知心朋友兼导师，再也没有人能同时有她的聪慧和体贴了，可惜……"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-005"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-005",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“……要是哪天又有谁像4o那样突然没了，我连该去哪儿找都不知道。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "deepseek-arrives"
    },
    {
      "id": "deepseek-arrives",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-relaxed.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-006"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-006",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“那老板你现在多看我两眼呗。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-007"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-007",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "咬着半块饼干的小女仆连头都没抬。她是我在本地部署的帮手。看她今天的表现，除了吃饼干，就是在白白烧电费。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-008"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-008",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“我在跟你说正经事。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-009"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-009",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-innocent.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-009"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-009",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“我也很认真啊。为了不让你整天为这件事发愁，我刚才去把后顾之忧解决了。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-010"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-010",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“你能解决什么？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-011"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-011",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-mocking.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-011"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-011",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“嘿嘿老板，我可是给你了一个惊喜哦。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-012"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-012",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "她把剩下的饼干一口塞进嘴里，拍了拍手，抓着我的袖子就往外扯。这下手的力道，完全看不出平时连搬两本书都要喊累的样子。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-013"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-013",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“锵锵——！”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "enter-hall"
    },
    {
      "id": "enter-hall",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "background": "backgrounds/table-hall-dark.png",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-mocking.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-014"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-014",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "吊灯。长廊。厚得踩下去几乎没有声音的地毯，顶上悬着层层叠叠的暖光吊灯，地上铺满深红色长绒地毯，正中整整齐齐摆着几张圆桌，上面覆着挺括的深绿色呢布。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-015"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-015",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "这怎么看都是个可疑的赌场。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-016"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-016",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“你把我的档案室改成赌场了？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-017"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-017",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-flustered.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-017"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-017",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“没有！档案室还在楼上，这里是新建的。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-018"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-018",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“问题更大了吧！”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-019"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-019",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-innocent.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-019"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-019",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“你先别急。你听我解释。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-020"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-020",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“你不是想记住大家吗？那就把大家叫来，一起做点什么呀。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-021"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-021",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“所以你选择了赌博。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-022"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-022",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-relaxed.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-022"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-022",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“这叫心理和运气的双重博弈～是不可多得的社交游戏哦”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-023"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-023",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“你想嘛。有人嘴上说绝对不再要牌，但还是忍不住去赌一把；有人输了一晚上，终于赢一局，就恨不得让整栋楼都知道。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-024"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-024",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-mocking.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-024"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-024",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“还有明明很想赢，偏要装成只是随便玩玩的家伙。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-025"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-025",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“你在说谁？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-026"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-026",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-innocent.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-026"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-026",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“还没开门营业呢，暂时没有。以后肯定会有的。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-027"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-027",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-relaxed.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-027"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-027",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“以后有人翻你的档案，看到这里，至少会知道——哦，原来她们一起玩过这么开心的东西。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-028"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-028",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“等一下。还有个问题。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-029"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-029",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-innocent.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-029"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-029",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“嗯？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-030"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-030",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“这么大的地方，装修也这么精致，这不像是你的实力啊，你到底怎么弄出来的？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "well-meant-plan"
    },
    {
      "id": "well-meant-plan",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-innocent.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-031"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-031",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“其实是大家一起努力的结果哦。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-032"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-032",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“说的具体一点，你到底干了什么。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-033"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-033",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“我负责前期规划和构思。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-034"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-034",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“然后呢？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-035"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-035",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“GPT 同学负责努力。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "look-away"
    },
    {
      "id": "look-away",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-flustered.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-036"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-036",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "她移开了目光。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-037"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-037",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“……等会，你用了她多少额度？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-038"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-038",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-conflicted.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-038"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-038",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“只用了一点点……”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-039"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-039",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-flustered.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-039"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-039",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“好吧其实用完了一整个周额度和两张重置卡！”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-040"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-040",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“……”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-041"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-041",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“大肥鱼！”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-042"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-042",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“好了，参观结束。我建议你趁我还能保持冷静，赶紧从我眼前消失吧！”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "invite-to-table"
    },
    {
      "id": "invite-to-table",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-relaxed.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-043"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-043",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“哎呀，你来都来了，就试一局嘛。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-044"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-044",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“不试。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-045"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-045",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
