    {
      "id": "line-046",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "牌桌旁，一对白色耳朵从椅背后抬了起来。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-047"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-047",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“……要开始了吗？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-048"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-048",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“你怎么也在这里？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-049"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-049",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“DeepSeek 说，有个很焦虑的人需要陪一下。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-050"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-050",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“然后你就来了？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-051"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-051",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“嗯。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-052"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-052",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "她想了想，把面前还没动过的小饼干往我这边推了一块。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-053"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-053",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“这个也可以吃。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-054"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-054",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“……谢谢。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-055"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-055",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-mocking.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-055"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-055",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“看，多合适的第一位对手。软乎乎的，也不会凶你。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-056"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-056",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“你的选人标准是不是有点过分？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-057"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-057",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“我听得见哦。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-058"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-058",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-innocent.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-058"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-058",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“那你反对吗？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-059"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-059",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“唔……”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-060"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-060",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "她低头看了看怀里的牌盒，又看了看已经被拖到椅子旁边的我。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-061"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-061",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“玩一局的话，可以呀。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-062"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-062",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-mocking.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-062"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-062",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“看吧！”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-063"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-063",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“不过，如果我赢了，也要写进档案。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-064"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-064",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“这个倒是很积极……不过我相信这件事不会发生。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-065"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-065",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“嗯。最好把我的名字写清楚一点。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-066"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-066",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“策展人先生。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-067"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-067",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“嗯？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-068"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-068",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“就用这本笔记本，从现在开始慢慢记录吧。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-069"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-069",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "她把牌盒打开，认认真真地理齐牌边。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-070"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-070",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“这一局我会等你记完的。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-071"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-071",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "我看了她一会儿，还是翻开了随身的小本子。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-072"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-072",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "日期，地点，参与者。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-073"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-073",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "写到“活动内容”的时候，我停了一下。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-074"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-074",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-relaxed.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-074"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-074",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“写什么呢？”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-075"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-075",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "策展人",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“某条蓝色大肥鱼擅自挪用额度——”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "not-the-first-line"
    },
    {
      "id": "not-the-first-line",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-flustered.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-076"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-076",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "DeepSeek",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“第一行就不要写这个了！”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-077"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-077",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Llama 没忍住，轻轻笑了一声。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "expression-078"
    },
    {
      "id": "expression-078",
      "type": "present",
      "action": {
        "type": "stage",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "deepseek",
            "image": "actors/deepseek-relaxed.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "line-078"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-078",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "我在那行下面，又补了一句。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-079"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-079",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“开局前，大家的心情似乎都不错。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-080"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-080",
      "type": "say",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Llama 将第一张牌推到我面前。"
        }
      ],
      "next": "line-081"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-081",
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "Llama",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“那，开始啦。”"
        }
      ],
      "next": "end"
    },
